WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.675
Time zones are easier when you separate the instant
from its display A

00:00:05.702 --> 00:00:11.273
timestamptz represents an instant That instant can
be displayed using

00:00:11.286 --> 00:00:16.985
Eastern time UTC or another zone The clock reading
changes

00:00:17.222 --> 00:00:22.881
but the underlying instant does not This distinction
is essential for logs

00:00:23.026 --> 00:00:25.684
orders and events collected across locations
